# SYMONE API rules for Cursor

API base: https://symone.fr/api-proxy
No authentication required for public endpoints.

Search routes: GET /route/get/results (returns all, filter client-side)
Paris-Marseille cache: GET /route/paris-marseille-cache
Cities near: GET /route/cities-near?location=Paris

Docs: https://symone.fr/api/index.md
OpenAPI: https://symone.fr/openapi.json
